# Initial provider: Groq free tier.
# The API base URL and model default to Groq and GPT-OSS 20B.
# Add MODEL_API_KEY only as a private backend/Render environment secret.
# Never commit a real key or expose it in frontend variables.
MODEL_API_KEY=
# Optional overrides when switching to another OpenAI-compatible provider:
# MODEL_API_BASE_URL=https://api.groq.com/openai/v1
# MODEL_NAME=openai/gpt-oss-20b
